<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>The Family · 로그인</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/app.css"><script src="/assets/js/login.js" defer></script></head>
<body class="login-page"><main class="login-shell"><section class="login-intro"><a class="wordmark" href="/">THE FAMILY<span>조직 운영 워크스페이스</span></a><div><p class="eyebrow">BETTER WORK, TOGETHER</p><h1>함께하는 일을<br>한곳에서.</h1><p>사람과 업무, 공용 자원까지.<br>우리 조직의 다음 움직임을 준비하세요.</p></div><p class="muted">MEMBERS · CREWS · WORK · RESOURCES</p></section><section class="login-card"><p class="eyebrow">WELCOME BACK</p><h2>워크스페이스 로그인</h2><p class="muted">발급받은 조직 계정으로 시작하세요.</p><form id="login-form"><label>아이디<input name="username" autocomplete="username" required maxlength="80"></label><label>비밀번호<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="128"></label><button type="submit">로그인 <span>→</span></button></form><p id="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="footnote">최초 계정은 서버의 <code>.local/initial-accounts.txt</code>에서 확인할 수 있습니다.</p></section></main></body></html>
